	(131, 14, 'CTV00002', 'NVR HIKVISION 8 CHANNEL PoE', 'HIKVISION 8 CHANNEL PoE 7108NI-Q1/8P/M\n8-ch Mini 1U 8 PoE NVR\n︎Up to 8 channel IP cameras can be connected\n︎Supports decoding H.265+/H.265/H.264+/H.264 video formats\n︎Up to 6 MP high-definition live view, storage and playback\n︎Up to 4-ch @ 1080p decoding capacity\n︎Up to 60 Mbps high incoming bandwidth ensures IP cameras can be connected\n︎1 HDD for continuous video recording\n︎Compatible with third-party network cameras\n︎Plug & Play with 8 Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) interfaces\n︎Metal case for professional industry applications.', '[{"id":"17","text":"GCC - General CCTV"}]', '2500000', '[{"varian":"Type","value":[{"id":"112","text":"7108NI-Q1/8P/M"}]}]', '2025-05-03 16:29:10', 5),
